


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_37a3f875:



    voice "2HI_0089"
    hina "「好冷～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7cee17df:



    voice "2FU_0061"
    fumi "「我回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_b4247473:



    voice "2SA_0062"
    sachiko "「欢迎回来——今天真的是格外的冷呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7e8dd69b:



    voice "2RI_0083"
    rin "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_33fb6b9d:



    voice "2SA_0063"
    sachiko "「谢谢啦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_e3c2e6f3:


    "伦把烟扔给祥子，祥子接住。一如既往的光景。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_e473ef88:


    "这件事要是让学校或者家长知道了可就严重了，但感觉这个宿管完全没有在意这一点。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_eed18a85:



    voice "2SA_0064"
    sachiko "「作为跑腿费，大家在自动贩卖机里挑一样自己喜欢的吧，我请客」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_558d55f0:


    "自动贩卖机是祥子的私有财产，她用从这儿得到的收入来买香烟。不过所有东西都是100日元，看起来……还挺良心的？"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_22446761:



    voice "2RI_0084"
    rin "「哇——好棒——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_3d221fb2:



    voice "2SA_0065"
    sachiko "「啊，现在只有冷的」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_fcd97619:



    voice "2HI_0090"
    hina "「你怎么这么没有季节感！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_c06ac880:



    voice "2SA_0066"
    sachiko "「之前夏天把啤酒放进去的时候，小阳菜可是气的要命呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_8af3f2d2:



    voice "2HI_0091"
    hina "「放到自己房间的冷藏柜里去！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_196bed98:


    "完全不是季节感的话题。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d44d1d87:



    voice "2RI_0085"
    rin "「看起来并不是按照顾客们的需求来的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_02114cf7:



    voice "2SA_0067"
    sachiko "「说到需求，香烟售卖机——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_89ee55a5:



    voice "2HI_0092"
    hina "「驳回！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_906c3b82:


    "这时，之前去玄关掸鞋上泥土的圣夜子回来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7c14448a:



    voice "2MI_0038"
    miyako "「我……回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7798130d:



    voice "2SA_0068"
    sachiko "「欢迎回来，圣夜夜」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_69d4f8de:



    voice "2MI_0039"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_0a9713e5:



    voice "2SA_0069"
    sachiko "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_183ba621:



    voice "2MI_0040"
    miyako "「我回来了，欢迎回来……这个，真的是非常不错呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_c2f64835:


    "对于圣夜子来说这是第一次的“我回来了”。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_12ff1b55:



    voice "2SA_0070"
    sachiko "「嗯，挺好的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_369a0322:


    "一方说着“我回来了”，另一方用“欢迎回来”回应。这种理所当然的事情在圣夜子看来似乎很新奇。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d8740dee:



    voice "2RI_0086"
    rin "「这个，你之前就一直这么叫来着，又是昵称吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_0eb3f81d:



    voice "2SA_0071"
    sachiko "「圣夜夜。不可爱吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_6f07402d:



    voice "2RI_0087"
    rin "「可爱倒是可爱。鹰冈同学觉得没关系吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_10a25c51:



    voice "2MI_0041"
    miyako "「我倒是觉得没什么。这样叫的话，也能知道是在叫自己」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_b62d2e6b:



    voice "2MI_0042"
    miyako "「而且，“圣夜子”这个名字也是祥子姐起的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_8b9fa8d3:



    voice "2FU_0062"
    fumi "「诶？祥子姐给圣夜子起的名字吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_79802d99:


    "圣夜子点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f2e9c2d8:



    voice "2HI_0093"
    hina "「这么说来两人年龄差很大啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_36cbdfcd:



    voice "2RI_0088"
    rin "「你看，果然不是堂妹，是侄女吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_4220fe43:



    voice "2SA_0072"
    sachiko "「喂！在那里偷偷摸摸说什么呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7ff10e3d:



    voice "2SA_0073"
    sachiko "「是圣夜子的父母在几个候选的名字中，选到了当时还很小的我想到的名字而已。对不对，圣夜夜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_3ae1d04f:



    voice "2MI_0043"
    miyako "「啊，是的。的确是这样的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f77596ad:


    "被糊弄过去了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_03b81eca:



    voice "2RI_0089"
    rin "「真的是，很快就能想到奇怪的昵称呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_2a099348:


    "阳菜亲啊，文文之类的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_af517328:



    voice "2SA_0074"
    sachiko "「不奇怪哦，伦伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_e98555c4:



    voice "2RI_0090"
    rin "「会理你就怪了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_2ae41edb:



    voice "2MI_0044"
    miyako "「伦伦？伦你也有昵称吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_719fba7d:



    voice "2HI_0094"
    hina "「只不过完全没定下来呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_4520dfbb:



    voice "2FU_0063"
    fumi "「无论怎么用昵称叫，都绝对不会回应的。简直是较上劲了呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_9353cd05:



    voice "2HI_0095"
    hina "「最终是祥子姐让步了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f3ebe27d:



    voice "2MI_0045"
    miyako "「原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f869efc0:



    voice "2SA_0075"
    sachiko "「对了对了。今天浴室完工了！虽然离通上煤气还有几天」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f73f7cd0:



    voice "2RI_0091B"
    rin "「终于好了吗！终于不用冻个半死去旁边宿舍洗澡了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_2df19a45:



    voice "2SA_0076"
    sachiko "「太好了呢，伦伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_b4cea685:



    voice "2RI_0092"
    rin "「真让人火大！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d1dd2296:



    voice "2SA_0077"
    sachiko "「本来应该寒假就能完工来着～结果不断地发现问题，最后变成了一个大工程」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_11b3ef58:



    voice "2FU_0064"
    fumi "「好多地方都有些损坏呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d15b8fb0:



    voice "2HI_0096"
    hina "「何止是损坏啊，简直是腐朽了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_9ce343b4:



    voice "2SA_0078"
    sachiko "「所以作为赔礼，特别批准你们第一个使用浴室怎么样」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_8d0acf0a:



    voice "2FU_0065"
    fumi "「太好了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_4c35048b:



    voice "2SA_0079"
    sachiko "「很宽敞的，所以大家一起洗吧～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d2d35912:



    voice "2HI_0097"
    hina "「你自己一个人洗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_54a84715:



    voice "2RI_0093B"
    rin "「我们能去看看澡堂吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_298ad750:



    voice "2SA_0080"
    sachiko "「不放水就行」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_41e2f258:



    voice "2RI_0094"
    rin "「明白了。走，阳菜，我们去看看吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_a1f27142:



    voice "2HI_0098"
    hina "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f7486423:


    "二人走向了澡堂，走廊里剩下三个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_9ed9ebbd:



    voice "2SA_0081"
    sachiko "「除了澡堂以外，还有想要修缮的地方吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_27453148:



    voice "2FU_0066"
    fumi "「嗯～水管什么的在入秋的时候都修好了，现在应该没问题吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_7da204e5:



    voice "2SA_0082"
    sachiko "「那样就好。说到水的话，屋顶漏雨还是有点在意呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_485ca688:



    voice "2FU_0067"
    fumi "「哇，这要是梅雨季节之前修不好的话，可叫人不安呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_e406c1b4:



    voice "2SA_0083"
    sachiko "「就是啊。房子老了，到处都有些破旧呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d758f02c:



    voice "2MI_0046"
    miyako "「你从什么时候开始看管这里的呀？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_420575e2:



    voice "2SA_0084"
    sachiko "「嗯……五年前吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_1528e184:



    voice "2FU_0068"
    fumi "「诶，这样的吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_ca27023f:



    voice "2MI_0047"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_0283da4c:



    voice "2SA_0085"
    sachiko "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f77ca170:


    "从刚才开始，澡堂那边就一直不时发出声响。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f19ebb1f:



    voice "2SA_0086"
    sachiko "「喂，从刚才开始你们就在干什么啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d58e113a:


    hina_rin "「看看有没有偷拍摄像头！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_02c170ee:



    voice "2SA_0087"
    sachiko "「我也太不被信任了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_3b59bfc1:



    voice "2FU_0069"
    fumi "「啊哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_acae532b:



    voice "2SA_0088"
    sachiko "「肯定不可能装在很容易发现的地方啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_835a91be:



    voice "2FU_0070"
    fumi "「……哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_c6c4a5ae:



    voice "2SA_0089"
    sachiko "「开玩笑嘛。真的没装啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_f9530ceb:



    voice "2MI_0048"
    miyako "「啊，对了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_cb7126e1:


    "一直微笑地看着四人的日常戏码的圣夜子，突然想起了什么事情，开始在包中翻找。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_d0be6354:



    voice "2MI_0049"
    miyako "「想请你在这些文件上盖个章呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_1f34d198:



    voice "2SA_0090"
    sachiko "「诶，盖章？我可不做借款的连带保证人哟？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_05f10ed7:



    voice "2MI_0050"
    miyako "「并不是那个——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_ca895abb:



    voice "2FU_0071"
    fumi "「我们有一个需要监护人填写的文件。如果寄回家里的话会很费时间，所以就想让作为亲戚的祥子姐来写」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_78388bc0:


    "文做了补充。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_0e6c1545:



    voice "2SA_0091"
    sachiko "「啊啊，原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_2cdc1075:


    "拿过文件来扫了一眼。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_42e841a3:



    voice "2SA_0092"
    sachiko "「明白了。我等会写，晚饭之后来取吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_216e1814:



    voice "2MI_0051"
    miyako "「谢谢你们」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_195e7152:


    "圣夜子连忙点头表示感谢。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_349cef5c:



    voice "2SA_0093"
    sachiko "「那么，得赶在那两个人把澡堂弄坏之前去看看。你们两个也去吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_5020fe82:


    fumi_miyako "「好」"




translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_05_bb1d8f64:


    "这件事要是让学校或者家长知道了可就严重了，但感觉这个宿管完全没有在意这一点。"
